  "label": "The Golden Girls TV Show",
  "description": "A popular American sitcom that aired from 1985 to 1992, featuring four older women living together in New York City. The show is known for its humor, strong female characters, and iconic cast. The term 'Golden Girl' refers to one of the main characters, and the phrase 'my favorite golden girl' is a direct reference to the show's cast members. Betty White played the character of Rose Nylund, one of the four main 'Golden Girls'.",
